{
  "_readme": [
    "Trades executed via LM tools (so ESPN has no TRADE_ACCEPT record) and",
    "pick swaps tracked in the commissioner's notes. Merged into activity.json.",
    "Each trade: {id, season, date: 'YYYY-MM-DD', week (scoring period it lands in),",
    "  teams: [teamA_id, teamB_id], valuation_snapshot_at: ISO timestamp,",
    "  assets: [",
    "    {player: 'Player Name', from: teamA_id, to: teamB_id, value: int|null}",
    "    {pick: '2027 2nd', from: teamB_id, to: teamA_id, value: int|null}",
    "  ]}",
    "value on each asset is the dynasty market value FROZEN at submission",
    "time (trade_tool.py cmd_submit) \u2014 trade_grades.py reads this back",
    "forever after rather than re-pricing old trades against today's",
    "market. Trades entered before this field existed have value: absent;",
    "trade_grades.py falls back to a current-value estimate for those and",
    "flags it (uses_current_value_fallback) so the UI can be honest about it.",
    "Player names are matched against the NFL player list; unmatched names fail",
    "the build loudly rather than guessing.",
    "pick_ownership: current holder of every traded future pick, one entry per",
    "pick: {season, round, original_team_id, owned_by_team_id, via: 'free text'}."
  ],
